  speakerName: 
  storyText: "GROUND FLOOR \u2014 ATHLETIC LOCKER ROOM"
  narrativeBeats:
  - The locker room smells of damp sweat, rubber soles, and stale chlorine drifting in from the adjoining athletic facilities. Rows of scarred green lockers and wooden benches stand in dim fluorescent lighting.
  - Discarded jerseys, tape, and sports equipment litter the floor where refugees rummaged in panic when the building was first secured.
  - Several lockers near the equipment cage stand ajar. You notice a couple of abandoned duffel bags tucked away in the shadows under a bench.
  - "[LOOT] Scavenge for usable gear (Work Gloves & Running Shoes).\r\n                        \r\n                    \r\n                \r\n                    The lockers have already been picked through. Nothing useful remains among the scattered debris."
  - "Head into the mechanical and utility room.\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                \r\n                Return to the East Hallway junction."
  dialogueLines: []
  initialFloorItems: []
